Here’s the full new version with:

- 🐟 normal fish = 1 point
- 🐠 golden fish = 100 points
- 🐶 dog = game over if it touches the cat
- A restart button after game over

Copy and paste the whole thing over your old code.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Cat Fish Catch</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: skyblue;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 10px;
    }

    #game {
      width: 600px;
      height: 400px;
